  "details": "Every time I load up VRchat as of April 18 to now April 20 the game glitches and makes me walk forward after opening the menu (I’ve disconnected my controllers and tried it on desktop mode and the same thing keeps happening) I move forward after awhile of closing and opening the menu after getting myself to stay still by opening expression menu then opening the menu it stops.\n\nIve been experiencing lag when changing avatars I have never had a issue switching avatars infact it would quickly load up, ive cleared my content cache and profile and avatar cache and the same thing keeps happening, id press on the avatar and press switch and it would taken 10 seconds to a minute before it decided to change me.\n\nAnother issue whenever I try and join or open my friends profile in game it takes 30 to a minute before it opens their profile so I can request to join or invite.\n\nI don’t know how to fix these and IDK if its the game or my install of the game or if there’s something else involved.",
